---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import pack from '../data/pack.json';
import uniformPair from '../assets/photos/uniform-pair.jpg';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Base
  title="Uniforms & Gear — Pack 358"
  description="What to actually buy for a new Cub Scout (and what to skip) — Pack 358's practical uniform guide."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker kicker--dark">GEAR GUIDE</span>
      <h1>Uniforms &amp; Gear (what to actually buy)</h1>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Don't buy anything before your first meeting.</strong>{' '}
        Come as you are, meet the den, and figure out sizing before you spend
        a dime. And if money's tight or your scout is between sizes, just
        ask us — we have a hand-me-down bin.
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-heading">First: "Class A" vs. "Class B"</h2>
      <div class="class-grid">
        <div class="card class-card">
          <h3>Class A — the formal uniform</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            The navy button-up shirt most people picture when they think "Scout" — patches,
            and eventually a neckerchief and slide. Worn at pack meetings, ceremonies, and
            anywhere we're representing the pack.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card class-card">
          <h3>Class B — the pack t-shirt</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Just our pack t-shirt. Worn for campouts, messy activities, and everyday den
            meetings. <strong>Every new scout gets one free with membership.</strong> Also
            available for purchase for adults.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="guide-grid">
        <div class="list-col">
          <div class="card list-card">
            <h2>Buy this</h2>
            <p class="lion-note">
              <strong>Lions &amp; Tigers: nothing!</strong> Your free Class B t-shirt is the whole
              uniform at this age. (But feel free to buy the uniform if you want to. It's
              adorable.)
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Official Cub Scout shirt — the Class A (from Wolf up)</li>
              <li>Neckerchief + slide</li>
              <li>Belt</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card list-card">
            <h2>Skip / ask first</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Official pants</li>
              <li>Official socks</li>
              <li>Hats</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="ask-note muted">
              Specifics vary by den — ask your den leader before you buy.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="uniform-photo">
          <Image
            src={uniformPair}
            alt="Two Pack 358 scouts in uniform — a younger scout in just the shirt, an older scout with hat, neckerchief and slide"
            widths={[420, 640]}
            sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 320px"
          />
          <figcaption class="muted">
            The whole range: younger scouts keep it simple; extras like hats and neckerchief styles
            come with rank.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-heading">By rank</h2>
      <div class="rank-grid">
        <div class="card rank-card">
          <h3>Lion &amp; Tiger</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Class-B t-shirt phase — the den t-shirt is all you need day to
            day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card rank-card">
          <h3>Wolf, Bear &amp; Webelos</h3>
          <p class="muted">The full blue uniform shirt comes into play.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card rank-card">
          <h3>Arrow of Light</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            May transition to the khaki (Scouts BSA-style) uniform.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-heading">Where to buy</h2>
      <div class="card shop-card">
        <div class="shop-info">
          <p><strong>{pack.scoutShop.name}</strong></p>
          <p class="muted shop-detail">{pack.scoutShop.fullName}</p>
          <p class="shop-detail">{pack.scoutShop.address} · {pack.scoutShop.phone}</p>
          <p>
            <a href="https://www.scoutshop.org">Shop online at scoutshop.org →</a>
          </p>
          <p class="muted">
            Before you buy new, ask us — we have a hand-me-down bin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="map-frame"
          href={`https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(pack.scoutShop.mapsQuery)}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label={`Open ${pack.scoutShop.name} in Google Maps`}
        >
          <div class="map-tiles">
            <img src="/map/tile-0-0.png" alt="" /><img src="/map/tile-1-0.png" alt="" /><img src="/map/tile-2-0.png" alt="" />
            <img src="/map/tile-0-1.png" alt="" /><img src="/map/tile-1-1.png" alt="" /><img src="/map/tile-2-1.png" alt="" />
          </div>
          <span class="map-pin" style="left: 40.7%; top: 52.6%;">📍</span>
          <span class="map-cta">Open in Google Maps →</span>
          <span class="map-attr">© OpenStreetMap</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-heading">Patch placement</h2>
      <p>
        Not sure where a patch goes? See the official{' '}
        <a href="https://www.scouting.org/resources/insignia-guide/"
          >BSA insignia guide</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p class="cost-summary muted">
        <strong>What it costs:</strong> uniform basics run about
        ${pack.fees.uniformLow}–${pack.fees.uniformHigh}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .callout {
    margin-top: 18px;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--orange);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .class-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .class-card {
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .class-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .class-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .lion-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .guide-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .guide-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .list-col {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .uniform-photo {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .uniform-photo :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(23, 51, 91, 0.15);
  }
  .uniform-photo figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .list-card {
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .list-card h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .list-card ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .ask-note {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .section-heading {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .rank-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .rank-card {
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .rank-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .shop-card {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 18px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .shop-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .shop-info p + p {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .shop-detail {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .map-frame {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(23, 51, 91, 0.15);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .map-tiles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    height: 100%;
  }
  .map-tiles img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .map-pin {
    position: absolute;
    transform: translate(-50%, -90%);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }
  .map-cta {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 8px;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .map-frame:hover .map-cta {
    background: var(--orange);
  }
  .map-attr {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8px;
    right: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .cost-summary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
